{"summary":"Escape into tranquility with Hexa Box, the relaxing puzzle.","description":"Unwind with Hexa Box: The Relaxing Puzzle\n\nEscape into a world of tranquil puzzles with Hexa Box, the ultimate relaxation companion for your mind.\n\nEmbark on an infinite journey of hexa puzzles, where each block fits perfectly into the frame like a tangram. Lose yourself in the calming process of dragging and arranging the hexagonal pieces, creating intricate patterns that soothe your soul.\n\nWith no time limits or pressure, Hexa Box is the perfect escape from the hustle and bustle of life. Let the soothing gameplay wash over you as you immerse yourself in a world of vibrant colors and satisfying shapes.\n\nWhether you're looking to de-stress, improve your spatial reasoning, or simply enjoy a moment of tranquility, Hexa Box is the puzzle game made for you. Download today and experience the relaxing power of puzzles!","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":"$0.99 - $10.99 per item","video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hLtevjdt_84?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/B1luC_EYUkCLKT1odKqwmxsepcCy4zC8KUhjOdMNgOt9LOH8ebaL1RahFNBLVboLs7DkSfL2T5tJT5WSPJUR3TE","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/L5XfiFdY4h1W-QkOBT7AIw_T13clsp9hQPOkh4604drcCAnglVBVbaCKRyTteODR6g47FedKdwh7UMA0_EpRbpI","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/lUDfbHEuS330R35lKPZkHozrV_YtpEgmEKwCNsrI0Bu7oEPtP0G1WyVCiiBc8YMzdD4IJA3HL-jhCqZZygd6vA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vhQ0enrLC4dnHrO_ia6rRHI_TuwbXDayysy5PQS5eCu1kfbYmVZfT-Sp49ercwsufDpn4fjbqNfZItVZ3A9P","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/NwsjKx7xL9Zpo07y1R4UfnNpV65z4tq3QcPVP9W3NY5dcqHRsQpvsTh_R3C6ChI-B3bdFo-UN5Nw7BOD8UfO","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/pawsV65Zm3pn4W6hJVAwEnKv0QcYfJ4_MgmZKGQsODyaebJDok4y-roUARIEB6jMi4AvuBsDgeqG5lIYIMcYmsw","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/N_39iHqEqKQ8aQE5NiQYYnwupVUeySWPTaRCnnnrvxZMg1wifXpE8MjCMFqVP-6yUhAiUpzaXwezQtW4IeYU8A","http